'''Hand Scope''' (Japanese: '''ハンドスコープ''' ''Hand Scope'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Promo-A}} series of cards.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Your opponent reveals their hand.
}}

==Release information==
Hand Scope cards were first made available to purchase from the in-game {{TCGP|shop}} on October 30, 2024 worldwide (September 26, 2024 in New Zealand) for 2 Shop Tickets each. One copy of Hand Scope is also awarded to players who complete the {{TCGP|Mission|mission}} "11: Attack the Weakness!" in the {{DL|Mission (TCG Pocket)|Battle Guide}}.

==Trivia==
This card's effect is identical to that of the {{TCG|Hand Scope}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].

===Origin===
* This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Phantom Forces|Hand Scope|96}} from the {{TCG|Phantom Forces}} expansion.

